1
00:00:00,310 --> 00:00:01,420
“Check-up later…

2
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:05,393
coin first!”… Riya's mom skipped
her test… a third time.

3
00:00:05,393 --> 00:00:08,307
But Dhanteras is also…
Dhanvantari's day.

4
00:00:08,307 --> 00:00:10,837
In the Bhagavata
Purana… gods and asuras…

5
00:00:10,837 --> 00:00:12,739
churn the ocean for amrita.

6
00:00:12,739 --> 00:00:15,099
First came poison, then Lakshmi…

7
00:00:15,099 --> 00:00:17,540
fortune. But the
churning didn't stop.

8
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:19,791
At last rose… Dhanvantari.

9
00:00:19,791 --> 00:00:22,175
In his hands… the pot of amrita.

10
00:00:22,175 --> 00:00:23,935
And today… on his day…

11
00:00:23,935 --> 00:00:25,578
we only count gold.

12
00:00:25,578 --> 00:00:26,608
Yet…

13
00:00:26,608 --> 00:00:30,231
about 1 in 3 Indian adults… has
high blood pressure.

14
00:00:30,311 --> 00:00:32,521
“Bearing a pot brimming with amrita…

15
00:00:32,521 --> 00:00:35,681
he was known as Dhanvantari,
the seer of Ayurveda.”

16
00:00:35,681 --> 00:00:40,302
Ayurveda-drik: one who knows
the science of life.

17
00:00:40,322 --> 00:00:42,410
For us today… the first
wealth… is health.

18
00:00:42,410 --> 00:00:46,260
So Riya… right at the jeweller's
counter… booked Mom's test.

19
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:48,590
Buy the coin… but the
test comes first.

20
00:00:48,590 --> 00:00:50,622
Who skips tests in your home?
